    <td style="width: 99%; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F1C_z70pTNd4Qip9" style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 8pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote000842" xml:lang="en-US">The
    Tradeable Warrants had an initial exercise price of $4.25, subject to adjustment. Upon the closing of the Company's private placement
