</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AA_zJvOSyfea11l" style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">As of December 31, 2023, all of the Pre-Funded
Warrants and a total of&#160;<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNonOptionEquityInstrumentsExercised_c20230101__20231231__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--TradeableWarrantsMember_z6TFZDR1ehLc" title="Warrants exercised"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNonOptionEquityInstrumentsExercised" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-12-31_custom_TradeableWarrantsMember" id="Fact000844" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">3,138,507</ix:nonFraction></span> Tradeable Warrants, <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNonOptionEquityInstrumentsExercised_c20230101__20231231__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--InvestorWarrantsMember_pdd" title="Warrants exercised"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNonOptionEquityInstrumentsExercised" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-12-31_custom_InvestorWarrantsMember" id="Fact000846" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">2,802,703</ix:nonFraction></span> Investor Warrants, and all of the May Pre-Funded Warrants were exercised
resulting in aggregate proceeds of $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromWarrantExercises_pp0p0_c20230101__20231231__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--AllWarrantsMember_zIL3ofgHG7X9" title="Proceeds from warrant exercises"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromWarrantExercises" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-12-31_custom_AllWarrantsMember" id="Fact000848" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">13,196,681</ix:nonFraction></span> received by the Company.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

