    <td style="width: 99%; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F11_zf2CaFmVGNHc" style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 8pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote000879" xml:lang="en-US">On
    October 12, 2023, the Company held a special meeting of the holders of its outstanding Tradeable Warrants in which a majority of
    the holders approved an amendment to the Warrant Agent Agreement to reduce the exercise price of the Tradeable Warrants from $2.22
    to $0.11 per warrant. The amendment was executed on October 18, 2023.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr>
