</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-01-01to2023-12-31" escape="true" id="Fact000881" name="us-gaap:EarningsPerShareTextBlock"><p id="xdx_800_eus-gaap--EarningsPerShareTextBlock_ztZHEx7vNYi" style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0; color: rgb(0,72,127); text-align: justify"><b><span style="text-decoration: underline">Note 10 &#8211;&#160;<span id="xdx_829_zgJzUt4QvrO7">Earnings Per Share</span></span></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The following table sets forth the computation
of basic and diluted net income per share for the years ended December 31:</p>

